-- riding skill, taught by the riding trainer next to the vendor; learning it also teaches Apprentice Riding.
-- No reputation lock any more (any race of the faction); speed still comes from the general Riding
-- (mod-riding-speed). Needs the rebuilt worldserver (IsRidingSkill: racial skill value 75).
